# Spec-Driven Development Rules

- Use spec-driven workflow for broad features, cross-role workflows, or unclear acceptance criteria.
- Start with a compact feature brief before implementation.
- Break work into spec, plan, tasks, implement, verify.
- Keep artifacts short, actionable, and traceable.
- Prefer asking short clarifying questions over guessing critical requirements.
- For implementation, only read the files needed to support the current stage.
